  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "No chapter paints purple heaven’s landscape as a place entered. It is named as one sky level among the immemorial nine.",
      "chapters": [
        371
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In The Legends of Ren Zu, the sky of the immemorial antiquity era had nine levels: white heaven, red heaven, orange heaven, yellow heaven, green heaven, azure heaven, blue heaven, purple heaven, and black heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        371
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At present, red, orange, yellow, green, azure, blue, and purple heavens are no more, and only white heaven and black heaven remain.",
      "chapters": [
        389
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Purple heaven is listed among the immemorial nine heavens and is later destroyed with red, orange, yellow, green, azure, and blue when Ren Zu’s son causes havoc, leaving only white and black heavens alternating between day and night.",
      "chapters": [
        466
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "destruction-among-seven-heavens",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit gives Fang Yuan a mission to go into immemorial purple heaven, search for a rank six immortal material, poisonous flowers, and collect their petals. Immemorial purple heaven is already destroyed. Even the fragment worlds are hard to find, and if found they are extremely dangerous, with desolate beasts and desolate plants very common.",
      "chapters": [
        776
      ],
